
================================================================================
  NUC5i7RYH coreboot flasher  (minimal live Linux)
================================================================================
  coreboot ROM : /opt/coreboot/coreboot-nuc5i7ryh.rom
  tool         : flashrom (internal programmer)
  login        : root (no password)

  Steps:
    1. backup-bios              # read+verify the factory firmware
    2. scp it OFF this machine  # rootfs is RAM-only; 'ip addr' for the IP
    3. flash-coreboot           # writes the BIOS region only, then verify
    4. poweroff, then power-cycle the NUC

  Recovery (if it will not POST): boot this ISO again and run
    flashrom -p internal --ifd -i bios -w /root/stock-bios.rom

  Only the BIOS region is touched; the factory descriptor/GbE/ME are kept.
================================================================================
